好きで、不登校だった響にプリントを届けたりと気にかけていた。パン屋「Sanois（サオノア）」でアルバイトをしている。趣味は釣りで、３巻の最後では響に釣り竿をプレゼントしている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":3,"birth_day":8,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"鸟海樱花","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"3月8日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"O型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"wiki","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":54787,"name":"尾城小梅","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/20/0c/54787_crt_lodOp.jpg","actor_ids":[4765],"name_cn":"尾城小梅","summary":"就读城见台小学校5年2班的女孩子。[mask]以“雾梦”一名进行活动，很有人气的网络绘师，因为喜欢响的歌曲而认识响并且帮他作画。[/mask]\r\n\r\n　　本身是双龙岛上贵龙神社的“龙之女巫”，从出生开始就要被当作“御灵代”侍奉。[mask]后来在响等人的帮忙下解放了御灵代的使命，和柚叶一起搬到响居住的地方生活。[/mask]","birth_year":null,"birth_month":7,"birth_day":7,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"尾城小梅","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"7月7日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"AB型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":54788,"name":"相ヶ江柚葉","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/24/4a/54788_crt_8k1zY.jpg","actor_ids":[4851],"name_cn":"相之江柚叶","summary":"高校1年生。\r\n中学時代に響のクラスに転校してきた女の子。端正な目鼻立ちでスタイルも良く、クラスでは目立つ存在。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":6,"birth_day":10,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"相之江柚叶","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"6月10日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"AB型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":54789,"name":"佐渡正義","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/62/01/54789_crt_rraPU.jpg","actor_ids":[4131],"name_cn":"佐渡正义","summary":"潤たちが暮らす家の保護者。愛称は「マスター」。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"佐渡正义","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"}]